    "title": "Tuberville Honors Enterprise Veteran John Logsdon as November Honoree - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Leah Barbary ,\n11 hours ago ENTERPRISE, Ala. (WDNews) — U.S. Senator Tommy Tuberville (R-AL) has named U.S. Navy Petty Officer First Class John Logsdon of Enterprise as Alabama’s “Veteran of the Month” for November. In a video announcement on November 3, Tuberville praised Logsdon for his lifelong dedication to service, both... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 10",
